IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-FAST-INFER.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ACTIVE-LAYERS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 TP-SIZE             PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FUSED-KERNELS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-TOKS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-FAST-INFER.
    IF ACTIVE-LAYERS == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE ACTIVE-LAYERS TO FUSED-KERNELS.
    MULTIPLY 3 BY FUSED-KERNELS.
    MOVE 5800 TO THROUGHPUT-TOKS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 FUSED-KERNELS.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-TOKS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
